Changelog: 24-11-2026 12:21:30

Fixed. The bottom row no longer has the label Other actions, and its pills start at the left. Show details and Show
advanced are now the pills Details and Advanced at the right end of that row. Under the name they say Show or Hide.
The window always opens 900 pixels wide, also when it was wider before. It fits its height to the page once it shows,
